cial-bloat-after-bulking-for-a-year.543516/"},{"title":"i think ive just found a legit and cheap bulking hack ectomorphs gtih","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/i-think-ive-just-found-a-legit-and-cheap-bulking-hack-ectomorphs-gtih.538333/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220803224752/https://looksmax.org/threads/i-think-ive-just-found-a-legit-and-cheap-bulking-hack-ectomorphs-gtih.538333/"},{"title":"i had the best physique for female gaze was pulling women like crazy and then fell for the bulking meme","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/i-had-the-best-physique-for-female-gaze-was-pulling-women-like-crazy-and-then-fell-for-the-bulking-meme.535669/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221020155956/https://looksmax.org/threads/i-had-the-best-physique-for-female-gaze-was-pulling-women-like-crazy-and-then-fell-for-the-bulking-meme.535669/"},{"title":"buccal fat removal and bulking","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/buccal-fat-removal-and-bulking.522666/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220711064146/https://looksmax.org/threads/buccal-fat-removal-and-bulking.522666/"},{"title":"54 guy bulking up from 138 pounds to 155 then gonna beat up an androgynic prettyboy femboy chad","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/54-guy-bulking-up-from-138-pounds-to-155-then-gonna-beat-up-an-androgynic-prettyboy-femboy-chad.412903/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211102171053/https://looksmax.org/threads/54-guy-bulking-up-from-138-pounds-to-155-then-gonna-beat-up-an-androgynic-prettyboy-femboy-chad.412903/"},{"title":"intermediate advanced lifters what is the ratio of muscle fat loss you burned when cutting and gained when bulking for those who measure it","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/intermediate-advanced-lifters-what-is-the-ratio-of-muscle-fat-loss-you-burned-when-cutting-and-gained-when-bulking-for-those-who-measure-it.412777/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211118120825/https://looksmax.org/threads/intermediate-advanced-lifters-what-is-the-ratio-of-muscle-fat-loss-you-burned-when-cutting-and-gained-when-bulking-for-those-who-measure-it.412777/"}],"web":[{"title":"Bodybuilding - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bodybuilding"},{"title":"Bulking (bodybuilding) - Grokipedia","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Bulking_(bodybuilding)"}]},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Bulking is a planned phase of eating above maintenance calories, combined with resistance training, to gain muscle and body weight. It is the counterpart of cutting, in which fat is lost.[1]","Bodybuilders traditionally bulk in the off-season and cut for contests; the length of the surplus determines how much fat accompanies muscle gain.[1] In looksmaxxing communities bulking is discussed for building a fuller, broader frame, and also debated for its effects on leanness and the face.[2][3]","Wikipedia states that the link between positive energy balance and muscle growth is well established, while noting uncertainty about how much muscle is retained through later cuts.[1]"],"infobox":[["Type","Calorie-surplus muscle-gain phase"],["Counterpart","Cutting"],["Variants","Clean (lean) bulk, dirty bulk"],["Typical context","Bodybuilding off-season, strength training"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Bulking means maintaining a calorie surplus to support muscle growth; the size of the surplus depends on goals, and a larger surplus or longer bulk adds more fat alongside muscle.[1]","Clean bulking aims to add muscle with little fat, usually with tracked calories and macronutrients and a slower pace. Dirty bulking uses a large surplus, often from calorie-dense food, and adds weight quickly with more fat, usually needing a longer cut later.[1]","Grokipedia gives clean-bulk surpluses of roughly 250 to 500 kcal above maintenance and traces the practice to strongman culture, Eugen Sandow and the Weider brothers, though this source is AI-generated and not independently verified.[4]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found. Related research on energy surplus and muscle mass exists in resistance-training literature, but none of the studies reviewed for this entry examined bulking as a looksmaxxing practice."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Reported risks","paras":["Wikipedia lists excess fat gain, a harder cut and, over time, possible effects on heart health and insulin sensitivity as risks of dirty bulking, and notes that anabolic steroid use, sometimes combined with bulking, carries serious risks.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"In looksmaxxing culture","paras":["Users on looksmax.org describe bulking after a long cut as a relief, with extra calories allowing more food and less cardio.[2] Others argue that natural lifters do not need a surplus beyond the first year of training or when underweight, favoring small surpluses instead.[3]"],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Bulking is discussed on looksmax.org as a way to build size, and as a trade-off with leanness.[2][3]","claims":[{"claim":"A calorie surplus is the way to gain muscle.","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Natural lifters do not need to bulk beyond early training.","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"A small surplus of about 250 calories gives minimal fat gain.","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Bodybuilding","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bodybuilding","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Bulking is lifefuel","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-is-lifefuel.1790299/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2025,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Bulking is not necessary to build muscle as a natural lifter","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-is-not-necessary-to-build-muscle-as-a-natural-lifter.1022044/","source":"looksmax.org","year":2023,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Bulking (bodybuilding)","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Bulking_(bodybuilding)","source":"Grokipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Bulking is lifefuel","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-is-lifefuel.1790299/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228190729/https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-is-lifefuel.1790299/"},{"title":"bulking absolutely cooks ur face in every way.","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-absolutely-cooks-ur-face-in-every-way.1789594/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228095344/https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-absolutely-cooks-ur-face-in-every-way.1789594/"},{"title":"Bulking is not necessary to build muscle as a natural lifter","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-is-not-necessary-to-build-muscle-as-a-natural-lifter.1022044/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240518185539/https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-is-not-necessary-to-build-muscle-as-a-natural-lifter.1022044/"},{"title":"bulking is gigacope no need to gymcell after this advice","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-is-gigacope-no-need-to-gymcell-after-this-advice.820598/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230919162325/https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-is-gigacope-no-need-to-gymcell-after-this-advice.820598/"},{"title":"bulking is the hardest thing i ever did in my life","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-is-the-hardest-thing-i-ever-did-in-my-life.696042/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230702232125/https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-is-the-hardest-thing-i-ever-did-in-my-life.696042/"},{"title":"bulking ruined my life","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-ruined-my-life.571823/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220920125328/https://looksmax.org/threads/bulking-ruined-my-life.571823/"},{"title":"bulking makes me extreme paranoid and anxious","url":"https://looksmax.